<augment_code_snippet path="server-scrcpy/build.gradle.kts" mode="EDIT">
```kotlin
import org.gradle.internal.os.OperatingSystem

plugins {
 id("java-library")
}

val androidJar = "${System.getenv("ANDROID_HOME")}/platforms/android-35/android.jar"
val buildToolsDir = "${System.getenv("ANDROID_HOME")}/build-tools/35.0.0"
val d8 = if (OperatingSystem.current().isWindows()) {
 "$buildToolsDir/d8.bat"
} else {
 "$buildToolsDir/d8"
}

java {
 sourceCompatibility = JavaVersion.VERSION_1_8
 targetCompatibility = JavaVersion.VERSION_1_8
}

dependencies {
 compileOnly(files(androidJar))
 testImplementation("junit:junit:4.13.2")
}

tasks.jar {
 archiveFileName.set("screenshot-service.jar")
 manifest {
 attributes(
 "Main-Class" to "com.screenshot.ScreenshotService"
 )
 }
 duplicatesStrategy = DuplicatesStrategy.EXCLUDE
}

tasks.register("buildExecutableJar") {
 dependsOn(tasks.jar)
 doLast {
 println("Executable jar built: ${tasks.jar.get().archiveFile.get()}")
 }
}

tasks.register<Exec>("buildDex") {
 dependsOn(tasks.jar)
 group = "build"
 description = "Convert jar to dex using d8"

 val dexOut = layout.buildDirectory.dir("dex").get().asFile

 doFirst {
 dexOut.mkdirs()
 }

 commandLine(
 d8,
 "--lib", androidJar,
 "--min-api", "21",
 "--output", dexOut.absolutePath,
 tasks.jar.get().archiveFile.get().asFile.absolutePath
 )
}

tasks.register("buildDexJar") {
 dependsOn("buildDex")
}
```
</augment_code_snippet>

主要变化：
- 字符串使用双引号
- `def` → `val`
- `files()` → `files()`
- `task` → `tasks.register()`
- `attributes()` 使用 `to` 语法
- `commandLine` 参数用逗号分隔
