<augment_code_snippet path="server-adb-shell/build.gradle.kts" mode="EDIT">
```kotlin
tasks.register<Exec>("buildDex") {
 dependsOn(tasks.jar)
 group = "build"
 description = "Convert jar to dex using d8"
 val dexOut = layout.buildDirectory.dir("dex").get().asFile
 val dexFileName = "server-adb-shell.dex" // 指定输出文件名

 doFirst {
 dexOut.mkdirs()
 }
 commandLine(
 d8,
 "--lib", androidJar,
 "--min-api", "21",
 "--output", dexOut.absolutePath,
 "--dex-file", dexFileName, // 添加文件名参数
 tasks.jar.get().archiveFile.get().asFile.absolutePath
 )
}
```
</augment_code_snippet>

或者直接在输出路径中指定完整文件路径：

<augment_code_snippet path="server-adb-shell/build.gradle.kts" mode="EDIT">
```kotlin
tasks.register<Exec>("buildDex") {
 dependsOn(tasks.jar)
 group = "build"
 description = "Convert jar to dex using d8"
 val dexOutDir = layout.buildDirectory.dir("dex").get().asFile
 val dexOutFile = File(dexOutDir, "server-adb-shell.dex")

 doFirst {
 dexOutDir.mkdirs()
 }
 commandLine(
 d8,
 "--lib", androidJar,
 "--min-api", "21",
 "--output", dexOutFile.absolutePath,
 tasks.jar.get().archiveFile.get().asFile.absolutePath
 )
}
```
</augment_code_snippet>
