这是什么原因","rich_text_json_repr":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"sagit:/data/local/tmp $ CLASSPATH=/data/local/tmp/k-server app_process com.github.kirer.adb.Launcher --port 8888 --debug"},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"Error changing dalvik-cache ownership : Permission denied"},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"Aborted "},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"134|sagit:/data/local/tmp $ "},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"这是什么原因"}]}]},"mentioned_items":[],"structured_output_nodes":[{"id":1,"type":0,"content":"这个错误是因为 `app_process` 命令缺少了必要的参数。根据你的部署脚本和错误信息，问题在于：

1. **缺少 `/system/bin` 参数**：`app_process` 需要指定一个目录参数
2. **权限问题**：dalvik-cache 权限被拒绝

正确的命令应该是：

```bash
CLASSPATH=/data/local/tmp/k-server app_process /system/bin com.github.kirer.adb.Launcher --port 8888 --debug
```

但是还需要更新部署脚本中的dex文件名。根据你之前修改的gradle配置，dex文件名应该是 `k-adb-shell-server.dex`：

<augment_code_snippet path="server-adb-shell/deploy.sh" mode="EDIT">
```bash
# 配置
DEVICE_PATH="/data/local/tmp"
SERVICE_DEX="k-adb-shell-server.dex" # 更新dex文件名
SERVICE_CLASS="com.github.kirer.adb.Launcher"
TEST_CLASS="com.github.kirer.adb.test.SocketClient"
SOCKET_PORT=8888
LOG_FILE="/sdcard/screenshot_service.log"
```
</augment_code_snippet>

<augment_code_snippet path="server-adb-shell/deploy.sh" mode="EDIT">
```bash
# 部署到设备
deploy() {
 log_info "部署到设备..."
 if adb push server-adb-shell/build/dex/k-adb-shell-server.dex $DEVICE_PATH/$SERVICE_DEX; then
 log_info "部署成功"
 else
 log_error "部署失败"
 exit 1
 fi
}
```
</augment_code_snippet>

然后手动执行正确的命令：

```bash
adb shell "CLASSPATH=/data/local/tmp/k-adb-shell-server.dex app_process /system/bin com.github.kirer.adb.Launcher --port 8888 --debug"
```
